Zora is an [[Bestiary/Realmtouched#Aphorite|aphorite]] dwarf and the current head of the Seed of Elders, the ruling council of [[Geography/Althane/Brejvasing/index|Brejvasing]]. Her skin is a uniform silver, and runes are inscribed in circles on her cheeks.

Zora died long ago. What remains of her lives in the machinery of her seat, from which she speaks for the council. She keeps to the old isolationist line, allowing outsiders into the Leviathan only for what they can offer the country, and wary of anyone who asks too many questions about the works beneath it.
